<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:26:50Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>美國民主黨歷史性勝利 深入共和黨票倉攻城掠地</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kgq8l48q2po/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T10:52:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kgq8l48q2po/trad--55c53ac6f7a6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kgq8l48q2po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">兩場一年前還被認為將勢均力敵的美國參議院選舉，最終都成為民主黨輕鬆取勝的選戰。</summary></entry><entry><title>德州翻藍：民主黨時隔38年首奪聯邦參議員席次</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrdzl8v6jjo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:26:44Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T10:11:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrdzl8v6jjo/trad--09d1864a146c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrdzl8v6jjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這場勝利不僅改寫德州數十年來的政治版圖，也進一步鞏固民主黨對美國國會的控制。</summary></entry><entry><title>篤定成為首位穆斯林美國參議員，42歲的賽義德是誰？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:14:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad--d191086536d0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6lykq34zd19o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在密歇根州，民主黨候選人阿卜杜勒·賽義德如今將成為美國首位穆斯林聯邦參議員。</summary></entry><entry><title>美智庫解析「技術民族主義」下的中俄軍工合作細節與限度</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad--3886ce690971.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c977pge1jkmdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">深圳APEC前夕，中俄「無上限」合有任何挑戰嗎？北京對烏克蘭停火興趣如何？在APEC中美俄三方領袖會面能有所突破？</summary></entry><entry><title>英王演說稱奴隸貿易是英國歷史「可恥的一章」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:26:47Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T07:06:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad--156f19761a90.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn734rxeye6o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">查爾斯三世在英聯邦政府首腦會議（CHOGM）發表這篇演說前，外界曾呼籲英國政府就英國在這項貿易中的歷史角色正式道歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026年美國中期選舉結果實時更新</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T05:47:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad--72bb211f5d7d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5rmyrm0n8k8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國國會由眾議院和參議院組成。眾議院全部435個議席都會改選，眾議員任期固定為兩年。與此同時，參議院100個議席中，有35席亦會進行改選。參議員任期為六年。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉民調：選民最關心經濟與民主現況</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg5xn3rk9po/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T04:33:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg5xn3rk9po/trad--a36b8a498de9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6kg5xn3rk9po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">選舉日的大型民調顯示，美國選民最不滿的是經濟狀況，接近三分之二人認為特朗普的政策讓美國經濟狀況惡化。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉：競選開支120億美元打破紀錄，馬斯克已花5億</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw99z83yxg4jo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T04:59:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw99z83yxg4jo/trad--6589893a90ae.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw99z83yxg4jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「加密貨幣公司在本個周期亦非常活躍，Ripple與Coinbase合共捐出6300萬美元，資助推動加密貨幣行業利益的超級政治行動委員會。」</summary></entry><entry><title>美國中期選舉：選舉有何影響、為何重要？七個關鍵問題解析</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx2qg1nn1wlo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T00:47:37Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx2qg1nn1wlo/trad--1ae934da6f5b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmx2qg1nn1wlo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國選民將於11月3日投票，這場選舉的結果可能對總統特朗普餘下任期產生重大影響。</summary></entry><entry><title>《蘋果日報》前社長張劍虹提早獲釋，向官媒稱「好懊悔」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T03:05:22Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad--e78de854d205.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6eq3ez3qvnxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">除了張劍虹，據報至少還有3名因《香港國安法》入獄的人士，亦已提早獲釋。外界關注，壹傳媒創辦人黎智英能否同獲假釋機會。</summary></entry><entry><title>英國移民改革改什麼？BNO港人會受影響嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T11:37:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad--d987e7df47e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c63r50z3npr7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">內政大臣公布改革英國永久居留要求的計劃。</summary></entry><entry><title>印尼有毒煙霾正令鄰國陷入政治難題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T00:23:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad--c5c9772ba0f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c91461p7mvv4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">新加坡和馬來西亞政府正夾在焦慮不安的民眾與脾氣暴躁的鄰國之間。</summary></entry><entry><title>如果黑客能夠控制超市的冷凍櫃，其他科技設備又有多脆弱？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T05:50:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad--4347d59bab79.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmkgk61rgzj4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">歐洲多個國家的數十家商店遭到網絡攻擊，影響其冷藏設備。</summary></entry><entry><title>金與正發文 朝鮮否認策劃63億美元幣安黑客攻擊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T02:49:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad--c825027219b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ckwyqjd9w4x7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國執法部門和網絡安全分析師將這宗破紀錄的盜竊案歸咎於平壤當局。</summary></entry><entry><title>「英國政府對華政策摸著石頭過河」——國會報告</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz654pezgx7o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T15:41:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz654pezgx7o/trad--0780f51f8cde.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz654pezgx7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">下議院商業、創新、科學與貿易委員會的一份報告指出，英國政府對華事務的決策過程持續地「前後矛盾」。</summary></entry><entry><title>台灣選舉：四成陸配參選遭剔除，「法理死結」如何困住參政之路？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T04:37:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad--f1b3d90e30e0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm4g1ynq5n5jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「除籍滿10年」如何計算，成為這屆選舉多位陸配被剔除參選資格的爭議焦點。今年有25位「陸配」參選，當中逾4成參選人不符參選資格。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能泡沫將爆破？這群「新雲端」公司正加劇市場擔憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5djvk2dm33xo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T00:17:42Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5djvk2dm33xo/trad--37ecb174a68a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c5djvk2dm33xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這些數據中心正滾存著數百億英鎊的債務。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我在橫店當王妃」：中國興起短劇體驗遊</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:26:50Z</updated><published>2026-11-04T13:04:02Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad--2a7324d8d98f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6n9rwjvvggjo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">穿上古裝、化身皇帝或妃嬪，親自出演一場宮廷大戲。在中國「好萊塢」，遊客不再只是旁觀者，而是能過一把當主角的癮。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何美國中期選舉對特朗普至關重要？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T09:45:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad--342d128aa70c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cqx2v747w8p1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國中期選舉將決定國會控制權歸屬，進而影響華盛頓未來兩年的權力格局。若民主黨奪回眾議院或參議院，可能制衡特朗普的施政議程。這場不見特朗普名字的選舉，卻可能深刻影響其總統任期後半程。</summary></entry><entry><title>姆巴佩的中國「烏龍」：毛澤東玩笑為何讓網民震怒？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T12:27:49Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad--79b75b230fe5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/c6gr87wj8dr9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">為什麼名人和大型品牌經常觸碰到中國的政治紅線？這又反映出中國對全球商業世界具有多大的影響力？他們的道歉是否足以平息這場代價高昂的風波？</summary></entry><entry><title>酒吧風波後，台北同志遊行在爭取什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmkgq4v0l2e4o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T17:30:05Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmkgq4v0l2e4o/trad--a8d115460224.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cmkgq4v0l2e4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">10月31日，約17萬人參與本年度台北同志遊行。作為東亞規模最大的同志平權活動之一，今年的遊行因台北一間同志酒吧遭警方搜查而增添政治意涵。</summary></entry><entry><title>習近平之後，中國將走向何方？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad#3</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T09:28:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad--3e76c4ad96f7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/watch/cm4g197q34l7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">隨著習近平打破傳統任期慣例，未來的權力繼承路徑與接班陣容充滿變數。權力交接、接班人選，以及習近平未來角色的討論，正在成為中國政治最受關注、也最難回答的問題之一。習近平之後，中國會走向何方？</summary></entry><entry><title>普京提議中美俄「三方會談」：特朗普響應，北京未表態，基輔反對</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T08:40:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad--076620887441.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmlyl0j445peo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在普京建議三方於APEC期間進行會談後，特朗普表示願意參與，強調會談重點將是無核化問題。目前中方尚未就三方會談表態。</summary></entry><entry><title>DeepSeek被美國政府系統禁用：中美AI競爭繼續升溫</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-20T07:42:45Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad--c79590262ebf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy0r4kd2462o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">DeepSeek的免費聊天機器人應用程式在Apple App Store下載排行榜上名列前茅，其AI模型也被美國科技企業採用。Snowflake、Vercel及OpenRouter等公司都已將DeepSeek整合至其提供給客戶的服務中。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>中共五中全會「空椅子」背後：常態化高壓反腐如何改變官場？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T13:23:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad--eb04c414483a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3j47p5gwj5lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">「這次全會進一步表明，習近平的反腐運動沒有終點。」專家說，「持續施加紀律壓力不應只是階段性運動，而必須成為中共運作方式中永久存在的一部分。」</summary></entry><entry><title>Netflix 重現斯坦福監獄「虐待性」研究應該嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:21:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad--4c829f30fc85.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g1xzw1jnpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Netflix將美國心理學家菲利普·津巴多 (Philip Zimbardo) 1971 年備受爭議的研究改編成了一部六集真人秀，重新引發了一場由來已久的辯論，並引發了關於科學與娛樂之間界限的新問題。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國施壓下姆巴佩道歉，但許多人仍不知道他究竟說了什麼</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T00:23:04Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad--0f6a387da94b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck4g18ql0vj9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">姆巴佩有關一名「中國領導人」的言論引發眾怒，但網絡審查令許多人仍不清楚事件究竟是怎麼回事。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我不希望它成為我的身份」：BBC專訪Hyrox失禁選手</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T05:40:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad--7b3627bd5422.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmy932qe3wx3o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這位澳洲運動員承認責任，但表示輿論反彈令她「創傷」。</summary></entry><entry><title>不得要求房客清潔——Airbnb的新守則如何引發分歧</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y1qjqz7po/trad#5</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-02T09:25:36Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y1qjqz7po/trad--9677e688d08e.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y1qjqz7po/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">根據11月生效的規定，愛彼迎（Airbnb）房東不得再要求房客清洗餐具或倒垃圾。</summary></entry><entry><title>新北市長選戰：「政二代」還是「專業副手」能拿下關鍵一城？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T11:31:47Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad--d30d3a72b78c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm9wzeg8ql22o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">作為全台人口最多的直轄市，新北市被視為「最關鍵戰場」，將判定藍綠整體勝負，並可能牽動2028年總統大選。</summary></entry><entry><title>印中關係緩和之際：印邊境官員稱中國軍隊大批集結並搭帳篷</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T00:23:07Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad--c22ccb93b383.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwkg5e249vmko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印中關係原本正處於謹慎的復甦階段，直到一位邊境官員的言論引發了人們對實際情況的新疑慮。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼歐洲各國年輕人走上街頭？背後的共同訴求和暴力隱憂</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T03:52:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad--af7f5220a503.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cv8ez8w9edzxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">過去一個月，歐洲各地爆發了由青年主導的示威遊行。這些遊行活動有何共同點？</summary></entry><entry><title>巴西前總統博索納羅之子敗給盧拉後，為何飛往美國？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-29T16:19:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad--c7ae9b4196f6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx5ynjr6q6gzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這位參議員離開巴西後，被拍到在美國走下飛機。他在巴西因涉嫌洗錢而接受調查。</summary></entry><entry><title>武契奇14年執政落幕，中塞「鐵桿友誼」何去何從？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T08:05:52Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad--bbb377741910.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw62y7lkvyn0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從總理到總統，武契奇領導的塞爾維亞進步黨（SNS）一步步將塞爾維亞打造成歐洲強硬的親華國家，中國亦曾形容兩國關係為「鐵桿友誼 」。外界關注這一親華總統敗選，將如何改變中塞關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>愛情、幸運與魔法：年輕人為何找上了網上女巫？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-03T00:22:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad--dc4a3ec2e5b1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crq8n9qq8q49o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一家網上零售商表示，他們有售有助帶來好運咒語，而最近購買的人數大幅上升。</summary></entry><entry><title>「見鬼了」：為什麼我們會產生超自然體驗？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-11-01T10:23:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad--39e1c5f76131.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm3vqy5g204vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">人類講述鬼故事已有數千年歷史，科學的進步並未改變這一點。</summary></entry><entry><title>如何不刻意鍛煉，也能增加活動量？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-30T00:20:50Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad--2e35c9832285.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylxpp7vjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">日常零星活動正顯現出保護健康的強大作用，其效果令人意外。它有助於我們消耗更多熱量，降低患心血管疾病的風險，甚至降低死亡風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>什麼時候「豪華經濟艙」值得多花錢？來比較2026年全球五強</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-28T08:27:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad--c7b431e0bccb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3n04z9jp75xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球豪經艙排名出來，台灣長榮及阿聯酋航空分佔冠亞軍。</summary></entry><entry><title>觀鳥如何重塑大腦，延緩認知衰退？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad#7</id><updated>2026-11-04T16:25:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-25T06:30:57Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad--bfe79e2154f9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ynx99yxzwo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">觀鳥近年愈來愈受長者和認知障礙症患者歡迎。研究人員分析這項活動對他們的身心健康有何影響，以及可能帶來哪些益處。</summary></entry></feed>
